\fs14\
\fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Initializes a newly allocated NSFormCell. Its title is set to \i aString\i0 ; the contents of its text entry field are set to the empty string (\'aa\'ba). The font for both title and text is the user\'27s chosen system font in 12.0 point, and the text area is drawn with a bezel. This method is the designated initializer for NSFormCell.\
\fs14\
\fs28 Returns self.\
