\fs14\
\i0 \fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Sets the cell title and a single mnemonic character. The mnemonic character, which follows the ampersand in \i titleWithAmpersand\i0 , serves as an Alt-key equivalent to clicking in the text entry field. \
\fs14\
\fs28 For example, if \i titleWithAmpersand\i0  is \'aaT&itle,\'ba the cell\'27s title will be displayed as \'aaT\ul i\ul0 tle\'ba (the mnemonic character, \i i\i0 , is underlined). If a user types Alt-i, it will have the same effect as clicking in the text entry field. \
\fs14\
